 to the grid.",[298,309,310],{"icon":220,"title":217,"to":218},[275,311,312],{},"A folder tree and a grid of files: select with a rubber band, drop on folders, Alt to copy.",[298,314,315],{"icon":225,"title":222,"to":223},[275,316,317],{},"Notion-like blocks moved by their handles, nested, and dragged in from a \"\u002F\" menu or the\nsidebar.",[298,319,320],{"icon":230,"title":227,"to":228},[275,321,322],{},"Legal moves light up, the piece in hand says why a square is refused, a pawn asks what it\nbecomes, and a bot plays back with real drags.",[298,324,325],{"icon":235,"title":232,"to":233},[275,326,327],{},"Nuxt UI fields from a palette, set side by side in rows, filled in a live preview and\nexported as Vue code.",[298,329,330],{"icon":240,"title":237,"to":238},[275,331,332],{},"Frames and layers on a zoomable canvas, smart guides, Alt to duplicate, and a layers panel\nthat is the design's tree.",[298,334,335],{"icon":245,"title":242,"to":243},[275,336,337],{},"Sections that turn into the real thing over the page, elements between columns, a layers\ntree on the same data, inline editing.",[298,339,340],{"icon":250,"title":247,"to":248},[275,341,342],{},"A Nuxt UI table of 2,000 tasks: virtualized, searchable, sorted by its rows' grips.",{"title":344,"searchDepth":345,"depth":345,"links":346},"",3,[347],{"id":289,"depth":348,"text":290},2,"Live demos with their code — every file you see runs on the page. Copy them, or open them in StackBlitz.","md",{},{"title":204,"icon":205},{"title":199,"description":349},"mZw0SrZnwL1lfj2VlxaUf1Nc9hogfFWr-p9RdiM_E3g",[356,358],{"title":194,"path":195,"stem":196,"description":357,"icon":197},"The small types every API page refers to — keys, coordinates, rects, element refs and reactive options.",{"title":207,"path":208,"stem":209,"description":359,"icon":210},"A product board in the spirit of Linear and Trello — columns you reorder, WIP limits, a question before Done, multi-select with a selection bar, filters the drags work through, a trash with Undo, and a card panel whose Status buttons play real drags.",1793588190537]